{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012VtjgNuzs4kqxPcEhXfNfT","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t#!/usr/bin/env python3\n2\t\"\"\"reality-ledger.py — Adaptive Execution Kernel claim-vs-evidence detector (advisory-only).\n3\t\n4\tPLAN-071 §4.3 Phase 2 deliverable. Walks the repo for divergence between\n5\tdocumented claims and runtime/code evidence, emitting findings in markdown\n6\t(local triage) or JSON/JSONL (audit-log + GH issue body) format.\n7\t\n8\tADVISORY ONLY: this script never blocks the CEO. Output is consumed by\n9\thumans + weekly CI advisory. Exit code 0 = success (with or without\n10\tfindings), 2 = detector internal error (Sec NTH #5).\n11\t\n12\tDetectors v1.14.0 (5 active; #5 default_flip_orphan deferred to v1.15.0+):\n13\t  1. runtime_read_missing       — env-var documented but no AST-level read\n14\t  2. installable_claim_drift    — installable claim, but install at HEAD fails\n15\t  3. model_assignment_divergence — claimed model != observed-majority model\n16\t  4. enforcement_commit_unpopulated — ADR ACCEPTED but no enforcement_commit SHA\n17\t  6. audit_action_phantom       — emitted action missing in _KNOWN_ACTIONS\n18\t\n19\tExclusions (anti-self-referential, post Round 1 R-SEC3):\n20\t  All detectors exclude `task-route.py`, `reality-ledger.py`, and\n21\t  `owner-ceremony/archive/**` from grep targets.\n22\t\n23\tOutput rendering (R2 R-CR-R2-3 + Codex P1 #1):\n24\t  --format markdown      INCLUDES claim_source_path  (local triage only)\n25\t  --format json/jsonl    EXCLUDES claim_source_path; SHA-only (audit-safe)\n26\t\n27\tAudit emission (deferred until KERNEL ceremony Phase 5 lands\n28\t`reality_ledger_finding` action in `audit_emit._KNOWN_ACTIONS`):\n29\t  hasattr-guarded best-effort emit; advisory-only fallback when unwired.\n30\t\"\"\"\n31\t\n32\tfrom __future__ import annotations\n33\t\n34\timport argparse\n35\timport ast\n36\timport hashlib\n37\timport json\n38\timport os\n39\timport re\n40\timport sys\n41\timport time\n42\timport unicodedata\n43\timport uuid\n44\tfrom datetime import datetime, timezone\n45\tfrom pathlib import Path\n46\tfrom typing import Any, Dict, FrozenSet, Iterable, List, Optional, Tuple\n47\t\n48\t# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n49\t# _lib / hooks imports — composition, not reimplementation\n50\t# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n51\t\n52\t_REPO_ROOT = Path(__file__).resolve().parent.parent.parent\n53\t_HOOKS_LIB = _REPO_ROOT / \".claude\" / \"hooks\"\n54\t\n55\tif str(_HOOKS_LIB) not in sys.path:\n56\t    sys.path.insert(0, str(_HOOKS_LIB))\n57\t\n58\ttry:\n59\t    from _lib.redact import redact_secrets  # noqa: F401  used in actual_evidence\n60\t    from _lib.secret_patterns import (\n61\t        _install_itimer_guard,\n62\t        _clear_itimer_guard,\n63\t        ScanBudgetExceeded,\n64\t    )\n65\texcept ImportError as exc:\n66\t    sys.stderr.write(\n67\t        f\"[reality-ledger] FATAL import error: {exc.__class__.__name__}: {exc}\\n\"\n68\t    )\n69\t    sys.exit(2)\n70\t\n71\t# audit_emit is imported lazily / hasattr-guarded inside _try_emit_finding\n72\t# so that running the script in environments where the action is not yet\n73\t# registered (pre-Phase-5 KERNEL ceremony) still works as advisory-only.\n74\t\n75\t# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n76\t# Constants\n77\t# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n78\t\n79\t# Domain declarations are bound to this module's globals, preserving callers'\n80\t# historical ability to replace helpers and constants on the facade.\n81\tfrom _lib._reality_ledger_parts import install as _install_parts\n82\t\n83\t_install_parts(globals())\n84\t\n85\tif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n86\t    sys.exit(main())\n87\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7f7338f3-f544-4c31-91bf-9348522f093d","uuid":"c9dd99e2-6ebd-4f4d-8a5f-